```
"entity_ref": {
  "description": "typed handle, `{kind, id, parent?}`. Examples: ... `{\"kind\": \"response\", \"id\": \"resp-1\"}`,
  "anyOf": [
    {"additionalProperties": {}, "type": "object"},
    {"type": "string"}
  ],
  "title": "EntityRef"
}
```

So entity_ref needs to be either an object with kind, id, and optionally parent; OR a string. The error message says: `kind - Field required`. So my object is missing `kind`. 

The issue is I'm just passing `{}` instead of `{"kind": "request", "id": "oauth_token_request"}`. Let me ensure I always pass both.

